                            {
                                "example_id": "3461e629-8dae-499e-9b79-5748c2a06b18",
                                "sense_id": "67848ca6-f73d-3ce1-981c-b903e5426fd2",
                                "text": "It was with a hilted knife maybe? I’m told, in the big world it’s bloody knives they use."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56e106e8-283b-4557-ac3a-ada91d80c222",
                                "sense_id": "67848ca6-f73d-3ce1-981c-b903e5426fd2",
                                "text": "Then he became aware of a princely figure in a caftan of green sarcenet clasped about his loins by a long tongued belt from which hung a scimitar hilted in ivory and gold."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "48c9cdc7-5fa4-3e2f-b841-d7b9936c084a",
                        "entry_id": "2e3104ff-0bf1-338c-b0ba-c5425cb3aaf2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a hilt of a specified type."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
