                                "sense_id": "48c9cdc7-5fa4-3e2f-b841-d7b9936c084a",
                                "text": "A steel-hilted sword, inlaid with gold, and decked with a knot of ribbon which fell down in a rich tassel, equipped his side […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e8d4607-172a-4f64-9b43-9b2907d946d2",
                                "sense_id": "48c9cdc7-5fa4-3e2f-b841-d7b9936c084a",
                                "text": "The grim-visaged pirate captain, in his laced cap, rich jacket, and short white knee-trunks, with heavy gold chains round his neck, and jewel-hilted dagger in belt, was a striking and characteristic feature of New York life at the close of the seventeenth century."
                            }
                        ]
